# Root diagnostic artifacts
/search_result.txt
/wsl_out.txt
/.pyright_errors.txt

# Run artifacts: keep only what a human reads.
# The eyes-on material (comparison_paragraphs.md, manual_edit_classes.md, comparison.md,
# final_package.md, excluded_blocks.md, validator_review_data.md, run summaries) is the
# reason artifacts/ is tracked at all — it is what a verdict gets read from, and it is
# small. The machine-readable dumps beside it are not: one paragraph-pair file is 2 MB,
# and four books of them outweigh the entire repository. They stay on disk next to the
# run that produced them.
artifacts/**/all_paragraph_pairs.jsonl
artifacts/**/source_blocks_with_narration_decision.json
artifacts/**/mechanical_checks.json
artifacts/**/*.tts.txt
artifacts/**/*.docx
artifacts/**/*_ru_literary_edit.md
artifacts/**/validator_review_data.json
